 ```
 
+`createPatch(from, to)` creates a compact RFC 6902 patch for a changed JSON document. It compares
+object members and array elements individually, so unchanged surrounding data is not included in
+the patch. Neither input is mutated.
+
+```ts
+import { createPatch } from 'json-toolkit';
+
+createPatch(
+  { services: { catalog: { replicas: 2 } } },
+  { services: { catalog: { replicas: 3 } } },
+); // [{ op: 'replace', path: '/services/catalog/replicas', value: 3 }]
+```
+
 ## JSON Merge Patch
 
 `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386).
